        <UserObject label="&lt;code data-start=&quot;592&quot; data-end=&quot;601&quot;&gt;Crawler will use below for Fairness:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/code&gt;1. Fetch robots.txt for politeness&lt;br&gt;2. MaxDepth to avoid crawler traps&lt;br&gt;3. Rate limit can be implemented by global Redis/Cache and jitter can be used among caller to break tie for sync calls among them." link="&lt;code data-start=&quot;592&quot; data-end=&quot;601&quot;&gt;options&lt;/code&gt; (robots.txt, maxDepth)" id="lHOm-4AiFmPZPP1cp-x2-48">
